  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "지고 말았다...\n포켓몬을 더 단련시킨 다음 다시 도전하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0ACE00020B9D0C558B2E4002E002E002E000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020B3540020B2E8B828C2DCD0A80020B2E4C74C0020B2E4C2DC0020B3C4C804D558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기서 질 수는 없다...\n다시 한번 도전하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C11C0020C9C80020C218B2940020C5C6B2E4002E002E002E000AB2E4C2DC0020D55CBC880020B3C4C804D558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "챌린지티켓을 확인했습니다!\n승급전 개최를 승인합니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC4CB9B0C9C0D2F0CF13C7440020D655C778D588C2B5B2C8B2E40021000AC2B9AE09C8040020AC1CCD5CB97C0020C2B9C778D569B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이대로 다시 도전하겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B300B85C0020B2E4C2DC0020B3C4C804D558ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다시 도전한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C2DC0020B3C4C804D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이어서 도전",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C5B4C11C0020B3C4C8040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포기한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECAE30D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이어서 도전을 선택하면\n상대의 HP가 줄어든 상태를 유지한 채로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다시 도전할 수 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이어서 도전을 선택하겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C5B4C11C0020B3C4C804C7440020C120D0DDD558BA74000AC0C1B300C758002000480050AC000020C904C5B4B4E00020C0C1D0DCB97C0020C720C9C0D55C0020CC44B85C00100001BE00000AB2E4C2DC0020B3C4C804D5600020C2180020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AC774C5B4C11C0020B3C4C804C7440020C120D0DDD558ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "선택하고 다시 도전한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C120D0DDD558ACE00020B2E4C2DC0020B3C4C804D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "선택하지 않고 다시 도전한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C120D0DDD558C9C00020C54AACE00020B2E4C2DC0020B3C4C804D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "돌아간다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3CCC544AC04B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어드바이스",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B4DCBC14C774C2A40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루카리오의 기술을 맞혀서\n메가파워 덩어리를 모으자.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8CE74B9ACC624C7580020AE30C220C7440020B9DED600C11C000ABA54AC00D30CC6CC0020B369C5B4B9ACB97C0020BAA8C73CC790002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가파워가 최대로 모이면\n<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+000C>Stick_R_Push을 눌러서 메가진화!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n강화된 기술을 연달아 사용해서 싸우자.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00D30CC6CCAC000020CD5CB300B85C0020BAA8C774BA74000A00100002BD0A000C0053007400690063006B005F0052005F0050007500730068C7440020B20CB7ECC11C0020BA54AC00C9C4D654002100100001BE00000AAC15D654B41C0020AE30C220C7440020C5F0B2ECC5440020C0ACC6A9D574C11C0020C2F8C6B0C790002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앱솔이 힘을 모으기 시작하면\n빠르게 거리를 벌리고 대비하자.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C571C194C7740020D798C7440020BAA8C73CAE300020C2DCC791D558BA74000ABE60B974AC8C0020AC70B9ACB97C0020BC8CB9ACACE00020B300BE44D558C790002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앱솔에게 너무 접근하면 위험하다!\n위급한 상황에는 <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0004>Sp_2를 눌러서 회피하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C571C194C5D0AC8C0020B108BB340020C811ADFCD558BA740020C704D5D8D558B2E40021000AC704AE09D55C0020C0C1D669C5D0B294002000100002BD0A000400530070005F0032B97C0020B20CB7ECC11C0020D68CD53CD558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스프레이의 효과가 사라졌다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D504B808C774C7580020D6A8ACFCAC000020C0ACB77CC84CB2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스프레이의 효과가 사라졌다!\n계속해서 쓰시겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
