      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000001000021900000100200010000201090001C5D0000AD604C7AC0020C0C1D669C7440020C801C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "완료하지 않은\n매지컬 교환이 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n인터넷에 접속해 주십시오.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C644B8CCD558C9C00020C54AC740000AB9E4C9C0CEEC0020AD50D658C7740020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AC778D130B137C5D00020C811C18DD5740020C8FCC2EDC2DCC624002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "떨어지기 전에 있었던 지점으로\n돌아가겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
